owers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/420667118","html_url":"https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/32721#issuecomment-420667118","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/32721","id":420667118,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQyMDY2NzExOA==","user":{"login":"cbismuth","id":21545602,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTQ1NjAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21545602?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth","html_url":"https://github.com/cbismuth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-09-12T14:23:02Z","updated_at":"2018-09-12T15:38:03Z","body":"Issue found.\r\n\r\n# Context\r\n\r\n* Exclusion setting `cluster.routing.allocation.exclude._host` default value is an empty string.\r\n* When an exclusion setting is sent with a `null` value the `o.e.c.s.Setting#innerGetRaw` API return an empty string (probably to avoid a `NullPointerException` to be raised).\r\n* The `o.e.c.r.a.d.FilterAllocationDecider` class is developed to omit updates of default values for exclusion setting.\r\n\r\n# Behavior\r\n\r\nThat's why a `null` exclusion setting value is translated to an empty string which is equals to the exclusion default value which is configured to be ignored.\r\n\r\n# Solution proposal\r\n\r\nA simple fix would be to not omit default values for exclusion setting and keep the `NullPointerException` guard. I'll find a way to finely test such a change and send a pull request.\r\n\r\n# References\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/6075e159e5e47e7ed38073e417feb8a818dde259/server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/cluster/routing/allocation/decider/FilterAllocationDecider.java#L105\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/6075e159e5e47e7ed38073e417feb8a818dde259/server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/common/settings/Setting.java#L461\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/blob/6075e159e5e47e7ed38073e417feb8a818dde259/server/src/main/java/org/elasticsearch/common/settings/Setting.java#L724","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/comments/420667118/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cbismuth","id":21545602,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxNTQ1NjAy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21545602?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth","html_url":"https://github.com/cbismuth","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cbismuth/followers","following_url"